{"sourceUrl":"https://law.sjtu.edu.cn/xw-tzgg/20260626/11157.html","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:32.773234+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://law.sjtu.edu.cn/xw-tzgg/20260626/11157.html","html":"<div>\n<p><br/></p><p><span><span>上海交通大学凯原法学院</span></span><span>“</span><span><span>卓越法律人夏令营</span></span><span>”</span><span><span>已成功举办</span></span><span><span>十五</span></span><span><span>届，获得广大学子热情关注与参与。夏令营旨在增进国内高校优秀本科生对凯原法学院的了解，促进各高校优秀本科生之间的交流。现我院拟</span></span><span><span>于</span></span><span>202</span><span>6</span><span><span>年</span></span><span>7</span><span><span>月</span></span><span>中下旬</span><span><span>举</span></span><span><span>办第</span></span><span><span>十六</span></span><span><span>届夏令营</span></span><span><span>，欢迎全国各地的优秀学子报名参加！</span></span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><strong><span><span>一、申请类型</span></span></strong></p><p><span>本次</span><span>夏令营</span><span>包括</span><span>：</span><span>法学</span><span>硕士</span><span>营</span><span>、</span><span>法律</span><span>硕士</span><span>（法学）</span><span>营</span><span>、</span><span>法律</span><span>硕士</span><span>（</span><span>非法学</span><span>）</span><span>营</span><span>、</span><span>本科直博营</span><span>。</span><span>申请</span><span>者</span><span>仅可选择一个</span><span>夏令营</span><span>类型</span><span>填报。</span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><strong><span><span>二</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>、申请资格</span></span></strong></p><p><span>1<span>、拥护中国共产党，热爱祖国，品德优良，遵纪守法，身心健康。</span></span></p><p><span>2<span>、</span></span><span>法学</span><span>硕士</span><span>营</span><span>、</span><span>法律</span><span>硕士</span><span>（</span><span>法学</span><span>）</span><span>营、</span><span>本科</span><span>直博</span><span>营</span><span>申请</span><span>人</span><span>须为</span><span>全国</span><span>双一流</span><span>建设</span><span>高校</span><span>及</span><span>建设</span><span>学科</span><span>、</span><span>传统</span><span>优势</span><span>政法</span><span>院校</span><span><span>202</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span>届</span><span>法学专业</span><span>本科</span><span>毕业生，</span><span>法律</span><span>硕士</span><span>（</span><span>非法学</span><span>）</span><span>营</span><span>申请</span><span>人</span><span>须</span><span>为</span><span>全国双一流建设高校及建设学科</span><span><span>2027</span><span>届</span></span><span>非</span><span>法学专业</span><span>本科毕业生</span><span>。</span></p><p><span><span>3</span></span><span>、</span><span>学习</span><span>成绩</span><span>优秀，</span><span>预计</span><span>可获得</span><span>所在</span><span>高校</span><span>推荐免试资格。</span></p><p><span>4<span>、</span></span><span>英语</span><span>水平</span><span>良</span><span>好</span><span>（</span><span><span>CET6</span><span>≥</span><span>425</span><span>或</span><span>TOEFL</span><span>≥</span><span>90</span><span>或</span><span>IELTS</span><span>≥</span><span>6.0</span></span><span>）</span><span>。</span></p><p><span>5<span>、在校期间无违纪表现或未受过处分。</span></span></p><p><span><span>特别优秀者第</span>3<span>、</span><span>4</span><span>条可适当放宽（如发表高水平论文、</span></span><span>高级别</span><span><span>竞赛获奖等）。</span></span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><strong><span><span>三</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>、申请材料</span></span></strong></p><p><span>1<span>、</span></span><span><span>个人简历（内容控制在一页</span>A4<span>纸）；</span></span></p><p><span>2<span>、</span></span><span><span>本科期间在校成绩单</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>加盖所在学校教务处</span></span><span><span>或</span></span><span><span>所在学院教务办的公章</span></span><span><span>）；</span></span></p><p><span>3<span>、</span></span><span><span>所在本科院校用于推免指标排序的成绩排名</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>前三学年或前五学期，</span></span><span><span>加盖所在学校教务处或所在学院教务办的公章，</span></span><span><span>同一院校申请人应采用同一排名规则）；</span></span></p><p><span>4</span><span><span>、英语成绩单（</span>CET6<span>、</span><span>TOEFL</span><span>、</span><span>IELTS</span><span>）扫描件或提供网上打印的成绩单加盖教务部门公章；</span></span></p><p><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>、两封副教授（含）以上职称教师的推荐信（</span></span><span>至少</span><span>一封</span><span>来自</span><span>所在</span><span>院系</span><span>，</span><span><span>无格式要求）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>、一份自荐信（格式内容不限）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>身份证、学生证、学籍认证报告（从学信网</span>www.chsi.com.cn<span>上在线验证并下载）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>8</span></span><span><span>、其他证明材料（如已发表论文、获奖或各类证书复印件等，合并为一份</span>PDF<span>文件）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>申请直博</span></span><span>营</span><span><span>的同学，</span></span><span>还需</span><span><span>准备如下材料：</span></span></p><p><span>9</span><span><span>、研究计划书一份</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span><span>备注：</span></span></p><p><span><span>1</span></span><span>、</span><span><span>申请阶段只需完成网上申请，不需提供纸质材料；</span></span></p><p><span><span>2</span></span><span>、</span><span><span>直博</span></span><span>营</span><span>申请</span><span>人</span><span>须</span><span>填写</span><span>意向</span><span>导师</span><span>，</span><span>博导</span><span>名单可</span><span>参考</span><span><span>2026</span></span><span>年</span><span>博导名单（</span><span><span>https://law.sjtu.edu.cn/yjszs/20250723/8875.html</span></span><span>）</span><span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3</span></span><span><span>、申请者须如实填写相关信息，如有不实将被取消入营资格或录取资格</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p><p><strong><span> </span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>四</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>、申请程序</span> </span></strong></p><p><span>申请人</span><span><span>请于</span></span><span>7</span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>10</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span>前</span></span><span><span>登录上海交通大学研究生院招生网（</span></span><span>http://ga.sjtu.edu.cn/zsgl/xlygl/default.aspx</span><span><span>）进行网上申请。请确保报名系统中填写的手机号码和邮箱正确，并保持联系方式畅通</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><strong><span><span>五</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>、夏令营活动安排</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>及注意事项</span></span></strong></p><p><span>1<span>、学院将根据申请者提交的材料，对申请</span></span><span>人</span><span><span>的教育背景、学业水平、科研能力、外语能力、综合素质等进行综合评价，确定入</span></span><span>营</span><span><span>名单。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2</span></span><span>、</span><span>夏令营</span><span>活动</span><span>安排</span><span>包括</span><span>学院</span><span>学科</span><span>介绍、</span><span>导师</span><span>与</span><span>学生</span><span>座谈交流</span><span>等</span><span>活动，</span><span>具体</span><span>活动</span><span>安排在</span><span>入营</span><span>名单</span><span>确定后</span><span>另行</span><span>通知</span><span>。</span></p><p><span><span>3</span></span><span><span>、夏令营期间所有营员必须遵守学校有关校园管理的规章制度和夏令营的要求与纪律，遵守夏令营的安排，按时参加活动。</span></span></p><p><span><span>4</span></span><span><span>、学院为营员购买夏令营活动期间人身意外伤害保险，所有营员须签订《安全责任协议书》，因违反协议规定所造成的人身安全和财产损失，责任自负。</span></span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span><span>凯原法学院将为营员提供免费的校内餐饮，往返交通费用及住宿费营员自理，欢迎校内外同学积极报名。</span></span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span>联系</span><span>地址</span><span>：</span><span>上海市</span><span>华山路</span><span><span>19</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>4</span></span><span>号</span><span>上海交通</span><span>大学</span></p><p><span><span>联系电话：</span>021-62934</span><span>511</span><span><span>、</span>62934340</span></p><p><span><span>联系邮箱：</span></span><span>lawjwb@sjtu.edu.cn</span></p><p><span><span>联</span></span> <span><span>系</span></span> <span><span>人：张老师、</span></span><span><span>付</span></span><span><span>老师</span></span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span><span>上海交通大学凯原法学院</span></span></p><p><span>202</span><span>6</span><span><span>年</span></span><span>6</span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>日</span></span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><br/></p>\n</div>","textSha256":"f9c1d0037b84797b68b7aa96e8c4ef961c65cd5045d321bcb8a9b4ae23b038c6","textLength":1457,"sourceSha256":"d054a24d729497ec7fe9e56bf5f59fa8b419e2993635f92678a909e8f25795a3","selector":"article-like:Article_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-0245b92fcd2abd7fe785","title":"2026年上海交通大学凯原法学院第十六届“卓越法律人夏令营”活动办法","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:32.773234+00:00"}
